Package: pmxvpc
Title: Pharmacometrics VPC Plot Generator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jayesh", "Patel", email = "stent41fanfare@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates Visual Predictive Check (VPC) plots for pharmacometric
    (PK/PD) model diagnostics by comparing simulated and observed
    concentration-time data. Supports prediction-corrected (pcVPC) and
    prediction- and variance-corrected (pvcVPC) rescaling, flexible time
    binning, stratification, and summary tables, following the method of
    Bergstrand, Hooker, Wallin, and Karlsson (2011)
    <doi:10.1208/s12248-011-9255-z>.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    grid,
    patchwork,
    readr,
    rlang,
    tibble
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
